    "Shared autocorrect expectations for the iOS and the Android keyboard (DESIGN §7, §10).",
    "Both test suites read this file and must give exactly these answers on the shipped dictionaries.",
    "layout: the keyboard layout (en, ru, kk). typed: the word before the caret. before: the text before that word.",
    "correction: what a separator turns the word into, or null to keep it.",
    "strip: the suggestion strip in display order: typed = the word as typed (shown in quotes), correction = the default a separator applies, word = any other word (Kazakh spelling hint, completion or candidate).",
    "Regenerate after an intended engine or dictionary change, and update both platforms in the same change.",
    "превт: привет is 1.7 away, within reach since §10.2, but 13th by score (право, прет, крест… score better), so it is not in the strip.",
    "Instruction verbs (поздравь, түсіндір…) are in supplement/<lang>_known.txt: a web corpus rarely has imperatives, and they must never be corrected."
